# StepFun's plan usage, in its usage panel.

## Setup: how to find each value the provider reads. Setting names,
## environment variables, URLs, cookie and header names, and the
## service's own menu paths stay as written.

usage-stepfun-setting-token = Your StepFun Oasis-Token. Sign in at https://platform.stepfun.com, open Developer Tools > Application > Cookies for platform.stepfun.com, and copy the value of the Oasis-Token cookie. Set webid too.
usage-stepfun-setting-webid = The value of the Oasis-Webid cookie next to Oasis-Token on platform.stepfun.com. StepFun rejects a token sent with another device's web id.
usage-stepfun-setting-cookie = Instead of token and webid: sign in at https://platform.stepfun.com, open Developer Tools > Application > Cookies for platform.stepfun.com, and copy the Oasis-Token and Oasis-Webid cookies as "Oasis-Token=…; Oasis-Webid=…".

## The report: a credit plan's monthly credit, as a usage window. Plan
## names stay as StepFun sends them.

usage-stepfun-credit = Credit
